    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gweanyeew sagalam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi malaykajeanda nea ghwararang'aana humng'eeda, nea ghoang'waanya geadi gidasiitina shoomanda mamuudeana ea munyaloalajeanda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoang'waay ichibooda was ichiboodida bea garayiin was meang'nyeandeenda ea Shataani, ak ghwarada gweanyeew sagalama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwajaksa niny jeeda shoomanda, hean gwadukuta ak ghwayiin giirooraneeda badaydaanyi, aba gideaba maygabiikta gicha gwareengani eemoojiga, ea ghang'ata gweanyeew sagalama. Amang'ata hiji gajeetin gilinuwaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi hoorgajeega gheambalmeeda, nea goobiitbiida badahuuka fuga jea goorgweach. Ak ghaadaayi gurooruunatka fuga ghayi silajaada gheatkweaka aba badayda muuwuunooda Yesu ea aba badayda ng'asheanda ASEETA, ea giika ghayi mii ghaghadoawan diyeaydideaniin ghana gidida siratiidean nea miighwanyas giirooraneadaanyi aba gheamamuunatka nyaawa, ghana geatinga nyaawa. Ak gwaduutu, ak goombaliischi sea Gristo gweanyeew sagalam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak muscheekiga siipuudiin ea mabiikta gwaduutu ea ghang'ata gweanyeew sagalam. Nih duunooda madeeda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'wana nea ghaydit siida mida jeeda duunooda madeeda! Aba badahuukeaba fiisu miyeedeaba iyeenya manda uurda ak gayghoah ashoohoodiga ASEETA ea gea Gristo, ak gaygoombaliischi sea niny gweanyeew sagalam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joorda Shataani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iyasha gweanyeew sagalama, gajeetin Shataani gwarina ghealoonigaaschi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghwahidu ak gwareengani eemoojiga mida murdajeega asang'wan bea ng'eanyiida, ak ea, Gogu gil ea Magogu, ak ghoawaam saawa aba ng'ucheeda; nea mooneeda nyaawa gwadeena iseaskweanda basooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwascheang'da gaweay badayda ng'eanyiida ak geeneaweesa gealga fuga ghaydidi ea mujiineedida sibwariiyiin; hean ghwararang'aan beasta leabu humng'eeda ak ghwaak saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geejaksa meang'nyeandida reengani saawaan jeeda basooda beasta ea giikayda heeda mida diyeaydida ea sibaneeda ng'uyyeega, ak gajeesawan askweari ea eawa ea ghoah damanda manda muudeanooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweaksiinda huuydean",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi hoorgeeda haw eesh bea gheambalmeeda ea siida apteadawa uhuuda; nea madeadaanyi gamng'aw ng'eanyiida ea humng'eeda, ak ea meadaaha heeda jea goobiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi fuga nimeewa, gea hees ea gea manang'i, nea ghamiinaada aba madeeda hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda, hean geetin gitaabwajeega. Ak geetin gitaabwajeanda nuut, nea gitaabooda eaweega gil. Ak geergweaksa fugiga nimeewean aba ng'asheega sing'oorsa jeedeaba gitaabwajeegiga, giduurji gidaghayi nisin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gooruudu basooda fuga nimeewa mida jeadaanyi, ak gooruudu miyeeda ea Gheeda maloonghajeega fuga nimeewa mida jeadaanyi, ak geergweaksiina sean gidaghayi nisin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geejaksa miyeeda ea Gheeda maloonghajeega jeedeaba basoodida bea beastean. Nea nih ea miyeedeaba iyeenya gil, basooni bea beastean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giliwas sih iimiyeeng'oorsa gheawungaaschi jeeda gitaabooda eaweega, hean geejaksa jeedeaba basoodida bea beastean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
